{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They left you for dead. Now, <strong>unleash the Nanostorm</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nanostorm</strong> is an incremental 2D arcade shoot'em'up game where you get stronger with every death. In the game, defeated enemies drop Nano-Essence, which you can spend in a <strong>massive skill tree</strong> on new abilities and powerful perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hostile alien world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded and alone after crash-landing on a deadly alien world, you discover that death isn't the end \u2013 it's the fuel for your rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Nanostorm, a <strong>fast-paced</strong>, horizontal <strong>incremental shoot'em'up</strong>. Obliterate endless waves of vicious pixel-art monsters and harvest the vital nano essence they bleed. Pour this essence into a vast skill tree, unlocking game-changing perks that transform you into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You start weak, but soon you will evolve into the storm</strong></u>. Gather enough strength to finally activate your ship's emergency warp core and escape this forsaken planet!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697670?t=1751193381","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697670/269048bdc1b903fe1b673dca766b35f7958dff21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751193381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697670/1ccb7471b65a663b6ed50146fd9997406f345326/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751193381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697670/1ccb7471b65a663b6ed50146fd9997406f345326/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751193381","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They left you for dead. Now, <strong>unleash the Nanostorm</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nanostorm</strong> is an incremental 2D arcade shoot'em'up game where you get stronger with every death. In the game, defeated enemies drop Nano-Essence, which you can spend in a <strong>massive skill tree</strong> on new abilities and powerful perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hostile alien world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded and alone after crash-landing on a deadly alien world, you discover that death isn't the end \u2013 it's the fuel for your rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Nanostorm, a <strong>fast-paced</strong>, horizontal <strong>incremental shoot'em'up</strong>. Obliterate endless waves of vicious pixel-art monsters and harvest the vital nano essence they bleed. Pour this essence into a vast skill tree, unlocking game-changing perks that transform you into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You start weak, but soon you will evolve into the storm</strong></u>. Gather enough strength to finally activate your ship's emergency warp core and escape this forsaken planet!</p>","developers":["Asylum Square"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697670/9b7a954df661389661c7582d7bdf6e517c3ebdc6/header.jpg?t=1751193381","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Asylum Square Interactive GmbH.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"mo